# UtsavFlow AI — Frontend Environment Variables
# In local development, leave blank so Vite dev proxy handles /api -> http://localhost:3001.
# In production static hosting, set this to your deployed backend origin (no trailing slash needed):
# Example: VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://utsavflow-api.onrender.com
#
# SECURITY NOTE:
# NEVER put GEMINI_API_KEY or any provider secrets in this file or any VITE_* variable!
# All VITE_* variables are bundled into public client-side JavaScript.

VITE_API_BASE_URL=
